 still_queued | distinct_events | max_attempts 
--------------+-----------------+--------------
            4 |               4 |            0

--- D. and the index refuses a duplicate outright, not by a check the caller might skip
psql:s15_read_queue.sql:44: WARNING:  a second open item for Q1 is refused by the index
--- E. turn it on: one lane, so exactly one item is handed out and it carries a release_at
 items | event | every_min | attempts | release_at_not_in_the_past | lanes | in_flight | spacing_ms 
-------+-------+-----------+----------+----------------------------+-------+-----------+------------
     1 | Q1    | 30        | 0        | t                          | 1     | 1         | 3000

--- F. a second worker gets nothing while the lane is busy — this is the 3-second rule held centrally
                                   second_worker                                    
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 {"items": [], "lanes": 1, "hold_s": 2, "reason": "all lanes busy", "in_flight": 1}

