------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 {"error": null, "outcome": "ok", "listings": 1, "queue_id": 1, "response_s": null}

 axs_event_id | outcome | resolved 
--------------+---------+----------
 Q1           | ok      | t

--- I. acking the same item again is harmless and charges nothing twice (a worker retrying a lost answer)
                         second_ack                         
------------------------------------------------------------
 {"outcome": "ok", "queue_id": 1, "already_resolved": true}

